。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p032","text":"孝王崩，諸侯復立懿王太子燮，是為夷王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m032-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孝王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000206","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m032-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"懿王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000205","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m032-0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"燮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000207","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m032-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"夷王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000207","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-004","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p033","text":"夷王崩，子厲王胡立。厲王即位三十年，好利，近榮夷公。大夫芮良夫諫厲王曰：「王室其將卑乎？夫榮公好專利而不知大難。夫利，百物之所生也，天地之所載也，而有專之，其害多矣。天地百物皆將取焉，何可專也？所怒甚多，不備大難。以是教王，王其能久乎？夫王人者，將導利而布之上下者也。使神人百物無不得極，猶日怵惕懼怨之來也。故《頌》曰『思文后稷，克配彼天，立我蒸民，莫匪爾極』。大雅曰『陳錫載周』。是不布利而懼難乎，故能載周以至于今。今王學專利，其可乎？匹夫專利，猶謂之盜，王而行之，其歸鮮矣。榮公若用，周必敗也。」厲王不聽，卒以榮公為卿士，用事。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m033-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"夷王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000207","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m033-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"厲王胡","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000208","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m033-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"厲王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000208","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m033-0022","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"榮夷公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000209","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m033-0028","start":28,"end":31,"surface":"芮良夫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000210","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m033-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"厲王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000208","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m033-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"榮公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000209","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m033-0162","start":162,"end":164,"surface":"后稷","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000046","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m033-0239","start":239,"end":241,"surface":"榮公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000209","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m033-0250","start":250,"end":252,"surface":"厲王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000208","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m033-0257","start":257,"end":259,"surface":"榮公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000209","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-004","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p010","text":"哀公時，紀侯譖之周，周烹哀公而立其弟靜，是為胡公。胡公徙都薄泵，而當周夷王之時。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m010-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"哀公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001085","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m010-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"紀侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001086","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m010-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"哀公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001085","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m010-0018","start":18,"end":19,"surface":"靜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001087","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m010-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"胡公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001087","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m010-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"胡公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001087","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m010-0034","start":34,"end":37,"surfa